# 本文件限制私有部署的构建上下文，避免上传本地密码、业务数据、依赖缓存和历史产物。
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
environments/*.env
private-data
**/release
**/data
**/logs
**/output
**/test-results
browser-extension/dist*
!browser-extension/dist-private
!browser-extension/dist-private/**
browser-extension/artifacts
cloud/backend/uploads
cloud/backend/secrets
cloud/backend/tmp
local-agent*
**/.DS_Store
